<urn:atm:triage:finding/AV3-M5>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AV3-M5" ;
  triage:title "just lint does not run cargo test -p atm-architecture, so Rust architecture gates are invisible to lint" ;
  triage:description "QA-r3 tooling gap: `just lint` reported 33/33 at the failing HEAD 8905f1046 because it runs only the Python gates (.just/*.py) and never `cargo test -p atm-architecture`; the AV.3 Rust architecture gates (D1/D2/D2b composition gates in crates/atm-architecture/tests/boundary_enforcement.rs) are therefore invisible to the lint entry point that devs and QA cite as evidence. Relevant to AV.3 D4's permanent CI-liveness-gate intent. Fix: wire `cargo test -p atm-architecture` (or a dedicated `just arch-gates` recipe invoked by lint) into the default lint path and record it in the sprint doc's D4 section." ;
  triage:phaseId "phase-av" ;
  triage:triageMode "initial_pass" ;
